.TH geectl-commit 1  "geectl-commit 0.2.4" 
.SH NAME
geectl\-commit \- Commit the staged changes
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgeectl commit\fR [\fB\-\-noservice\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fB\-m\fR|\fB\-\-message\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Commit the staged changes
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-m\fR, \fB\-\-message\fR \fI<MESSAGE>\fR
The commit message
.TP
\fB\-\-noservice\fR
Skip the service gate (source services and `pre_checkin.sh`)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH VERSION
v0.2.4
